/ The answer to categorising a line, or to "Change", from the list: the transaction's rows as they are now
/ (categorised, or unchanged with the reason nothing was saved). After "Change" the focus goes back to it.
/ A transaction deleted meanwhile leaves the list.
- if @transaction
  = turbo_stream.replace dom_id(@transaction, :list), partial: "transactions/transaction",
    locals: { transaction: @transaction, filter: @filter, message: @message, focus_change: @focus_change }
- else
  = turbo_stream.remove "list_transaction_#{params[:id].to_s.to_i}"
